<h1>Starpoint Software Price List</h1>



<h3>
	Perpetual Single User Licensing:
</h3>
<ul>
	<li>All products listed are available as <strong>single user licenses only</strong>.  Software may be installed on only one computer per license.&nbsp; Contact us for multi-user discounts or annual licenses.</li>
	<li>There is no restriction on the numbers of monitored sites or facilities on which the software is used.</li>
	<li>All licenses include <strong>free upgrades within one year of purchase</strong>.</li>
	<li>All licenses are perpetual. All upgrades are optional. We cannot guarantee that any version you buy today will run on future versions of Windows.</li>
</ul>

<h4 align="left">All Prices in U.S. Dollars</h4>
<h4 align="left">No &quot;Per Facility&quot; Fees!</h4>
